{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--stage-launch","name":"stage-launch","description":"Phase 2 of building a Claude Managed Agent — turn a validated build sheet into exact API payloads and a resumable BYOK curl launch script, then launch (environment → agent → session → kickoff) using the founder's OWN Anthropic key. Use when the user says \"launch it\", \"deploy the agent\", \"create the agent now\", or when the orchestrator routes phase=stage-launch. payload_generator.py emits the four ordered payloads; launch_script_writer.py writes launch.sh that reads $ANTHROPIC_API_KEY at runtime and never embeds it; payload_validator.py runs a pre-launch check including an API-key-leak scan. No tool in this skill makes network calls — the user runs launch.sh themselves. Distinct from interview (planning) and grade-iterate (the outcome loop).","category":"Cloud & DevOps","tags":["stage","launch","phase","building","claude","managed","agent","turn","validated","sheet","into","exact","api","payloads","resumable","byok","curl","script"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"agent-launcher/skills/stage-launch","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/agent-launcher/skills/stage-launch","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":6,"bytes":21604,"sha256":"466f59676c36c423ddb7ce2cfc23466407083627b91d764a52410d9a793db12e","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"README.md","sourcePath":"agent-launcher/skills/stage-launch/README.md","bytes":1060,"sha256":"3b76d41f439355aed81be98999a13748234fb121491e42ca8ed4b43d96e6c251","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/agent-launcher/skills/stage-launch/README.